[COMMAND]:      image.update.dev
[PACKAGE]:      IMAGE
[USE]:          dock -image update.dev

[OUT]:          Stops the container in the current directory, deletes the parent image, 
                and starts the container again.

[ACTIONS]:      dock -stop -del
                docker image rm $IMAGE_FULL_NAME
                dock -start

[NOTES]:        More information available in the image.sh script.
